<h2>
"Code and tables"
</h2>
<pre>
<code>
"fn main() { println!(\"hello\"); }"
</code>
</pre>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>
"Name"
</th>
<th>
"Score"
</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
"alpha"
</td>
<td>
"10"
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
"beta"
</td>
<td>
"20"
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>
"Links and footnotes"
</h2>
<p>
"An external link:"
<a href="https://example.com">
"Example"
</a>
"and an id link"
<a href="#abc-123">
"abc-123"
</a>
"."
</p>
<p>
"Text with a footnote reference."
<sup>
<a href="#fn-1">
"1"
</a>
</sup>
</p>
<h2>
"Blocks"
</h2>
<blockquote>
<p>
"A quoted paragraph."
</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<section>
<hr>
<ol>
<li>
<p>
"The footnote definition."
</p>
<a href="#fnr-1">
"↩"
</a>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
